shi refuses saying PI’s have no business investigating murders. But can she stay away?","duration":42,"scws_id":376972,"season_id":9698,"created_at":"2025-09-26T16:36:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:41:45.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-09-26 18:36:17","images":[{"id":278966,"filename":"999f99ed-94ad-4e90-924a-955f5604ba9c.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":123274,"created_at":"2025-09-26T16:36:18.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T16:36:18.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/999f99ed-94ad-4e90-924a-955f5604ba9c.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":356278,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":123274,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 1"}]},{"id":123277,"number":2,"name":"Episodio 2","plot":"Still unsure, Meenakshi starts digging. She starts suspecting that the dead man was somehow linked to a mysterious virus outbreak in the village of Littnong, Eastern Himalayas.","duration":42,"scws_id":376974,"season_id":9698,"created_at":"2025-09-26T16:38:09.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:41:45.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-09-26 18:38:09","images":[{"id":278977,"filename":"8f1d8a17-3a76-434b-a534-fca6e754955b.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":123277,"created_at":"2025-09-26T16:38:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T16:38:10.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/8f1d8a17-3a76-434b-a534-fca6e754955b.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":356287,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":123277,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 2"}]},{"id":123275,"number":3,"name":"Episodio 3","plot":"Now convinced that the young man was indeed killed, Meenakshi undertakes a reckless journey to Littnong, seeking to find the killer.","duration":35,"scws_id":376975,"se